p=root/'README.md'; p.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\n\n## v1.4.8 — Univest Back in Entry Range ₹5,000 add\n- A genuine Univest Idea back in Entry Range alert for an already-open eligible equity campaign triggers one extra fixed ₹5,000 CASH/CNC DELIVERY market buy.\n- A later genuine alert can add another ₹5,000; duplicate callbacks carrying the same Android notification timestamp are suppressed.\n- The existing ₹5,000 price ladder at −2/−4/−6/−8% remains separate.\n- After fill, cost/quantity/charges are updated and the −20% protective GTT is resized; the ₹2,500 net-profit monitor uses the updated position.\n- If flat but the recommendation is still open, any pending automatic re-entry GTT is cancelled before the explicit ₹5,000 range re-entry.\n- Officially EXITED or untracked symbols ignore these alerts. v1.4.7 Holdings/T1 exit reconciliation and Multyfi/manual logic remain unchanged.\n''')
